# 一つの実身は一つのウインドウで開く (design 11.4), for tools/ui_run.py. A copy of
# 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc 5) is linked into BTRON (linkbig) and opened by a double press on
# its link: the text editor's process opens it. Double pressed again while that window is
# up, it is brought to the front and no second window opens; two double presses one after
# the other, the second while the process is still being started, open one window too.
# While it is open, 実行 of the link's menu is grey; closed, 実行 can be chosen again and
# the link opens it again. The same in a process's window: a copy of 画用紙 opened by the
# figure editor's process (A), the text's link pasted into it, double pressed from there
# brings the text's window forward, and 実行 of that link's menu in A is grey (the
# desktop answers DT_RQ_APPS with no program for an object open already).
# Keys: Ctrl+E 08 01, Ctrl+C 06 01, Ctrl+V 19 01.
mkbig doc 5
linkbig 190 100
wait 300
# opened, and the window moved down off the link
logmark
dclick 200 109
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 5
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 1
win 基本文章編集
keep docwin
drag 400 108 400 520
wait 800
# BTRON in front, then the link double pressed again: the text's window comes forward
click 260 109
wait 300
logmark
dclick 200 109
expectsince desktop: open already, window
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 1
focus d1 基本文章編集
want ok d1: has the keys
# 実行 of the link's menu grey while it is open
click 260 109
wait 300
logmark
click 200 109 1
expectsince cabinet: exec menu grey
wait 500
click 800 700
wait 500
# closed: 実行 can be chosen again
logmark
click 400 530
wait 300
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 0
logmark
click 200 109 1
expectsince cabinet: exec menu on
wait 500
click 800 700
wait 500
# two double presses at once: one window (the second finds the start under way, "window 0", or
# the window up already, as the start goes quickly or not)
logmark
dclick 200 109
dclick 200 109
expectsince desktop: open already, window
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 5
wait 3000
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 1
# asked again while it was starting: the window takes the keys as it comes up
focus d2 基本文章編集
want ok d2: has the keys
shot oo_one
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 0
# the same from a process's window: A, a copy of 画用紙, with the text's link pasted in
mkbig fig 30 4
linkbig 180 45
wait 300
click 250 109
wait 300
key 06 01
wait 300
logmark
dclick 190 52
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
key 19 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 33 shapes 1 picked
wait 500
click 600 500
wait 300
# the text opened from its link in A, then double pressed there again: one window, forward
logmark
dclick 360 225
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 5
wait 800
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
dclick 360 225
expectsince desktop: open already, window
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 1
focus p1 基本文章編集
want ok p1: has the keys
# 実行 of the link's menu in A grey while the text is open
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
click 360 225 1
expectsince figure: exec menu grey
wait 500
shot oo_fig_menu
click 1000 700
wait 500
# closed (Ctrl+E in the text's window, brought forward by its link): 実行 in A can be chosen again
logmark
dclick 360 225
expectsince desktop: open already, window
wait 500
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 0
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
click 360 225 1
expectsince figure: exec menu on
wait 500
click 1000 700
wait 500
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: closed
wait 800
# a template in the 原紙箱's window (a process): opened once
click 1000 48
wait 300
logmark
dclick 970 80
expectsincein 60 document: opened
wait 800
click 1000 48
wait 300
logmark
dclick 970 80
expectsince desktop: open already, window
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 1
shot oo_basebox
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 800
nwin 基本文章編集
want ok 0
absent !OACV!
